  "about": {
    "title": "BRUTAL AND RIGID ENGINEERING REFLECTED IN ARCHITECTURE",
    "description": "BRABUS ISLAND Baku brings the \"One-Second-Wow\" philosophy of BRABUS, Germany's bold supercar and engineering brand, to the shores of the Caspian Sea. Developed by RS Capital (a collaboration between Sabah Investment Group and Reportage Group), the official sales are handled by Treva Real Estate. It is a unique waterfront residence vision shaped by sharp lines, monochrome aesthetics, and pure BRABUS DNA-defying conventional living standards."
  },
